# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# LINE ENDINGS — force LF (Unix) on EVERY text file, regardless of contributor OS.
# Vercel build containers are Linux (LF). Without this rule, Windows users
# pushing CRLF line endings cause:
#   • git warnings: "LF will be replaced by CRLF"
#   • sporadic hashbang/JSON parse failures when the serverless function is
#     invoked (the Node runtime on Linux occasionally rejects a stray \r).
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
* text=auto eol=lf

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# BINARIES — never diffed or line-ending-mangled
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.svg binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.otf binary
*.ttf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary

# VCS file-type hints
*.ts   text diff=typescript
*.tsx  text diff=typescript
*.js   text diff=javascript
*.jsx  text diff=javascript
*.json text diff=json
*.md   text diff=markdown
*.html text diff=html
*.css  text diff=css